Adaptation: EmberBSD Ports, AI-assisted GCC16 CMake cross packaging. No source patch.
This package extends the same common Boost source and header namespace.
The package owns libboost_iostreams, its required compiled libboost_random closure,
and their component CMake exports. Random-device support remains enabled.
Base zlib, bzip2 and lzma compression are enabled. Zstd support is excluded.
New header-only Dynamic Bitset CMake exports belong to this closure.
All common Boost headers and existing header exports remain owned by boost-headers.
